  "description": "Gyu-Ha, who had a hard time getting Tae-Oh, whom he had a crush on in high school, to date. The two dated for 10 years without any major problems. Until Tae-Oh got into an accident. Tae-Oh collapsed in a building fire and strangely lost all of his memories of Gyu-Ha. Instead of his old, affectionate self, he returned to his usual, annoying self. Will Gyu-Ha be able to get Tae-Oh back?\n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)\n\n*Note: Part of the Geogeoikseon: Heavenly Original Webtoon Danpyeonseon (거거익선~헤븐리 오리지널 웹툰 단편선~) Collection.*",
